OL,3,GNEWSASerious crash closes A5 between
OL,4,AWeedon and Kilsby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A5 has been closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections between Weedon and Kilsby,
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire, following a serious
OL,9,Fcollision involving two cars.
OL,11,FPolice said it happened at about 06:00
OL,12,FBST, at Watling Street, and it was in
OL,13,Fattendance, along with the fire
OL,14,Fservice.
OL,16,FIt said a white Kia Sportage and a
OL,17,Fblack BMW X5 collided and the Kia
OL,18,Fdriver was taken to hospital with
OL,19,Fsuspected life-threatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
