OL,3,GNEWSASerious crash closes A5 between
OL,4,AWeedon and Kilsby
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said it was assisting
OL,7,Ftraffic management and due to
OL,8,F"collision investigation work and the
OL,9,Froad is expected to remain closed for
OL,10,Fseveral hours".
